WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.667
Here. Steepest part. Shoot it here and that's our growth curve.

00:00:02.667 --> 00:00:05.333
That's a staircase.

00:00:05.333 --> 00:00:08.000
Deploy more agents. Fill the frame, look bigger.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Just tilt the lens. Every downhill is an uphill from somewhere.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Tilted it. We're number one now.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.000
You tilted the camera. Not the number.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.000
I shot it from the other side. From here it's all downhill.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.000
We'll take measured numbers over camera angles. Nothing tilts inside our own rack.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Finally, a number I don't have to infer.

